1
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:46,900
"The Missing Piece"

2
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:51,800
(Episode 3)

3
00:02:13,240 --> 00:02:14,039
Come here.

4
00:02:14,039 --> 00:02:15,039
Take your medicine.

5
00:02:32,439 --> 00:02:33,439
Mr. Ji.

6
00:02:34,199 --> 00:02:35,199
Are you cold?

7
00:02:41,199 --> 00:02:42,199
Come here.

8
00:03:24,439 --> 00:03:26,599
My coworkers ostracized
me again at work today.

9
00:03:29,479 --> 00:03:31,039
Actually, I still prefer painting.

10
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:35,560
Zhou Yang.

11
00:03:38,639 --> 00:03:39,879
Why aren't you saying anything?

12
00:03:48,199 --> 00:03:49,199
I'm not Zhou Yang.

13
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:09,680
What's wrong?

14
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,120
Nothing.

15
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:14,560
Come here.

16
00:04:16,439 --> 00:04:17,439
Don't move.

17
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,839
Did I wake you up?

18
00:04:26,319 --> 00:04:27,480
You've been asleep all day.

19
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,800
You'd already gotten enough sleep.

20
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:35,240
How are you feeling now?

21
00:04:40,519 --> 00:04:41,560
I'm feeling better.

22
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:43,760
You're still a little hot.

23
00:04:44,519 --> 00:04:45,879
Do you want to go to the hospital?

24
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:50,000
No.

25
00:04:55,199 --> 00:04:59,480
Mr. Ji and I signed an agreement that day.

26
00:05:00,199 --> 00:05:02,439
It requires me to pretend
to be his boyfriend in public.

27
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:06,399
I don't think he said when
the agreement would end.

28
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:10,519
What if Ji An'an and Zhou
Yang grow old together?

29
00:05:11,279 --> 00:05:15,079
What will happen to Ji Mingxuan and me?

30
00:05:22,839 --> 00:05:23,839
Mr. Ji.

31
00:05:23,879 --> 00:05:25,240
Are you feeling any better?

32
00:05:25,959 --> 00:05:26,959
Pretty much.

33
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:30,720
Then I'll head to the office.

34
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:32,840
They needed me to
handle something last time.

35
00:05:33,199 --> 00:05:34,279
You're not going.

36
00:05:34,639 --> 00:05:35,480
But I...

37
00:05:35,639 --> 00:05:37,120
I'm the owner of the company.

38
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:38,040
Nothing

39
00:05:38,041 --> 00:05:39,119
is more important

40
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:40,560
than you staying to take care of me.

41
00:05:46,959 --> 00:05:48,319
I'm craving spareribs.

42
00:05:50,399 --> 00:05:51,680
Yes, boss.

43
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:54,040
I'll go buy some.

44
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,360
Shen Mo.

45
00:06:15,519 --> 00:06:17,639
I brought all your things over.

46
00:06:17,839 --> 00:06:18,839
Huh?

47
00:06:18,959 --> 00:06:19,959
This...

48
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:21,439
What does this mean?

49
00:06:21,639 --> 00:06:23,815
You're supposed to take care of me
for the next few days.

50
00:06:23,839 --> 00:06:25,439
It'll be more convenient if you move in.

51
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:28,959
I thought Mr. Ji had recovered.

52
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:33,600
Not completely.

53
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:46,519
When is Ms. Ji coming back?

54
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:48,839
An'an went on a trip.

55
00:06:49,199 --> 00:06:50,319
She'll be back next week.

56
00:06:50,759 --> 00:06:51,920
She went alone?

57
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:55,240
Do you really think that's possible?

58
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:59,319
She went with Zhou Yang.

59
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:00,800
Right.

60
00:07:01,959 --> 00:07:03,480
They left on the twelfth.

61
00:07:04,519 --> 00:07:05,519
The twelfth?

62
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:07,839
That was the day Zhou
Yang asked to meet me.

63
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,360
I didn't go.

64
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:11,800
He turned around and left with Ji An'an.

65
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:14,399
What if I had gone?

66
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:21,519
Then I'll make you some spareribs.

67
00:07:22,639 --> 00:07:23,639
Yeah.

68
00:07:40,639 --> 00:07:41,639
Mr. Ji.

69
00:07:52,639 --> 00:07:54,199
We should still go to the hospital.

70
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:57,000
There's no need.

71
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,600
I'm fine.

72
00:08:03,519 --> 00:08:07,199
Sorry, the subscriber
you dialed is temporarily unavailable.

73
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:08,800
Please try again later.

74
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:11,638
Sorry, the subscriber you dialed is busy.

75
00:08:11,639 --> 00:08:13,279
Old Zhang must be asleep.

76
00:08:16,639 --> 00:08:18,279
I'll drive you to the hospital.

77
00:08:18,639 --> 00:08:19,000
Come on.

78
00:08:19,399 --> 00:08:20,399
Let's go.

79
00:08:26,439 --> 00:08:27,199
Let me do it.

80
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:27,839
Let me do it.

81
00:08:27,839 --> 00:08:28,839
Mr. Ji.

82
00:08:47,639 --> 00:08:48,639
Hang in there.

83
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:11,439
I wrote down the doctor's prescription

84
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:13,320
on the box over there.

85
00:09:13,639 --> 00:09:14,759
Especially this medicine.

86
00:09:14,879 --> 00:09:16,239
Make sure you remember to take it.

87
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:17,360
Take it before bed.

88
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,679
Where are you going?

89
00:09:18,879 --> 00:09:20,120
I'm not going anywhere.

90
00:09:20,559 --> 00:09:21,960
Then why do I have to remember?

91
00:09:22,399 --> 00:09:24,559
Can't you just remind
me to take it before bed?

92
00:09:25,679 --> 00:09:27,038
Does this mean

93
00:09:27,039 --> 00:09:29,320
I still can't go back to my room to sleep?

94
00:09:33,759 --> 00:09:35,159
I'm still sick.

95
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:42,280
You really don't want to sleep with me?

96
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,320
No, no.

97
00:10:02,976 --> 00:10:05,503
[Contemporary Art Exhibition]

98
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:54,000
I'm not going to the office today.

99
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:56,440
What about me?

100
00:10:57,440 --> 00:10:58,440
You're not going either.

101
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:00,399
Come with me somewhere.

102
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:07,919
Why did we suddenly come here?

103
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:12,200
Can't we do something
cultural for a change?

104
00:11:16,360 --> 00:11:17,600
Wow.

105
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:55,519
I don't know why,

106
00:11:56,240 --> 00:11:59,080
but this painting
feels so sad.

107
00:12:00,039 --> 00:12:01,399
I don't see any sadness.

108
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:04,120
All I see is happiness and joy.

109
00:12:05,279 --> 00:12:07,000
Is Mr. Ji interested in art,

110
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:11,519
or did he see me come
across this art exhibit

111
00:12:12,240 --> 00:12:13,519
and bring me here on purpose?

112
00:12:17,200 --> 00:12:17,480
Sir.

113
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:19,559
I'll take this Ferris wheel painting.

114
00:12:31,399 --> 00:12:32,879
I'm back!

115
00:12:34,360 --> 00:12:35,519
Did you miss me?

116
00:12:35,679 --> 00:12:36,679
Of course.

117
00:12:38,679 --> 00:12:39,679
This is a gift.

118
00:12:40,879 --> 00:12:42,936
It's a shame Zhou Yang had
something come up at home.

119
00:12:42,960 --> 00:12:44,559
Otherwise, I could've bought more.

120
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:46,279
This is more than enough.

121
00:12:47,679 --> 00:12:48,839
Did you have fun there?

122
00:12:48,840 --> 00:12:49,840
It was so much fun.

123
00:12:49,879 --> 00:12:52,080
I've never seen such blue water.

124
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:53,719
I wish I could stay there forever.

125
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:54,999
It was just one trip.

126
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:56,320
And now you've got a wild streak.

127
00:12:57,399 --> 00:12:59,599
Mostly, we have Big Brother to thank for
buying the plane tickets.

128
00:12:59,600 --> 00:13:01,720
You and Big Brother Shen
should go together sometime.

129
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:04,918
Mr. Ji arranged the trip for you two?

130
00:13:04,919 --> 00:13:05,919
Yeah.

131
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:07,000
I did.

132
00:13:10,639 --> 00:13:11,519
That day, Big Brother

133
00:13:11,520 --> 00:13:12,678
suddenly pulled out plane tickets

134
00:13:12,679 --> 00:13:14,158
and told me to go on a trip with Zhou Yang.

135
00:13:14,159 --> 00:13:15,519
It completely took me by surprise.

136
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:17,159
Now that's what I call a surprise.

137
00:13:18,279 --> 00:13:20,600
It was definitely a pleasant surprise.

138
00:13:20,759 --> 00:13:21,799
And Zhou Yang, he...

139
00:13:26,919 --> 00:13:28,240
I'm going to make dinner.

140
00:13:41,240 --> 00:13:44,039
Zhou Yang asked me to
meet him on the twelfth.

141
00:13:44,759 --> 00:13:46,960
Ji Mingxuan suddenly
sent Ji An'an plane tickets.

142
00:13:47,600 --> 00:13:48,920
Could it really be a coincidence?

143
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:16,279
Do you need any help?

144
00:14:16,399 --> 00:14:17,039
No.

145
00:14:17,040 --> 00:14:18,120
It'll be ready soon.

146
00:14:18,480 --> 00:14:19,600
Is Ms. Ji hungry?

147
00:14:19,879 --> 00:14:20,879
No.

148
00:14:21,159 --> 00:14:22,519
An'an was exhausted from the trip.

149
00:14:22,600 --> 00:14:23,799
She went to her room to rest.

150
00:14:24,559 --> 00:14:26,559
Mr. Ji, do you want braised pork or curry?

151
00:14:29,759 --> 00:14:30,559
Aren't you curious

152
00:14:30,560 --> 00:14:32,320
about what An'an just told me?

153
00:14:33,639 --> 00:14:35,559
That's between you and An'an.

154
00:14:35,679 --> 00:14:36,679
It's not my place to ask.

155
00:14:37,200 --> 00:14:38,279
An'an told me

156
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:40,559
that Zhou Yang proposed to her.

157
00:14:45,519 --> 00:14:47,000
Looks like I'm making curry.

158
00:14:50,279 --> 00:14:51,840
She already said yes.

159
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:55,480
That's wonderful.

160
00:14:56,159 --> 00:14:58,119
After dating for a long
time, people get married.

161
00:15:04,480 --> 00:15:05,840
You're pretty calm.

162
00:15:07,799 --> 00:15:09,519
It must be hard pretending nothing's wrong.

163
00:15:12,120 --> 00:15:13,840
If you're upset, just say so.

164
00:15:15,519 --> 00:15:16,519
I'm not.

165
00:15:16,919 --> 00:15:18,399
What he does is his business.

166
00:15:19,279 --> 00:15:20,440
It has nothing to do with me.

167
00:15:29,600 --> 00:15:31,000
Zhou Yang is getting married.

168
00:15:31,720 --> 00:15:33,759
You must be hurting like hell inside.

169
00:15:34,039 --> 00:15:35,759
And you're still pretending in front of me.

170
00:15:36,399 --> 00:15:37,399
I'm not.

171
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:38,440
Still being stubborn.

172
00:15:39,399 --> 00:15:41,600
If you can't forget Zhou Yang, just say it.

173
00:15:42,120 --> 00:15:43,840
Say the word, and I'll let you go to him.

174
00:15:45,360 --> 00:15:46,960
Hasn't he always wanted to see you?

175
00:15:47,799 --> 00:15:49,519
I don't believe you don't want to see him.

176
00:15:51,279 --> 00:15:53,039
I'm already Mr. Ji's man.

177
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:54,919
We signed a contract.

178
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:57,559
I won't break it.

179
00:16:03,320 --> 00:16:05,040
The contract can be terminated immediately.

180
00:16:05,279 --> 00:16:07,159
This is your last chance.

181
00:16:07,399 --> 00:16:09,200
I've made my position clear.

182
00:16:10,039 --> 00:16:11,039
Mr. Ji.

183
00:16:36,440 --> 00:16:37,559
Congratulations, Ms. Ji.

184
00:16:38,240 --> 00:16:39,639
When's the wedding?

185
00:16:41,039 --> 00:16:42,959
Big Brother, how did
you spill the news so fast?

186
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:44,799
Yeah.

187
00:16:44,800 --> 00:16:45,960
It won't be that soon.

188
00:16:46,120 --> 00:16:48,240
Big Brother says we
should get engaged first.

189
00:17:00,600 --> 00:17:03,320
I'll discuss it with the
Zhou family's elders.

190
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:05,000
Right away.

191
00:17:05,240 --> 00:17:07,119
Zhou Yang will be family soon.

192
00:17:07,200 --> 00:17:08,200
Yeah.

193
00:17:09,960 --> 00:17:10,960
Family.

194
00:17:11,759 --> 00:17:12,799
How ironic.

195
00:17:13,480 --> 00:17:14,800
What have I done to deserve this?

196
00:17:15,279 --> 00:17:17,200
To be included in "we"?

197
00:17:18,400 --> 00:17:19,160
Big Brother Shen.

198
00:17:19,359 --> 00:17:21,400
You're really off your game today.

199
00:17:21,599 --> 00:17:23,079
These potatoes are too salty.

200
00:17:33,519 --> 00:17:34,519
They really are salty.

201
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:37,720
They're so salty, they're bitter.

202
00:17:41,039 --> 00:17:43,920
It must be because Big Brother Shen
heard you're getting married

203
00:17:44,119 --> 00:17:45,160
and got too excited.

204
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:53,359
I'll fix it.

205
00:17:54,599 --> 00:17:55,599
Hey.

206
00:17:56,799 --> 00:17:59,079
Just adjust it a little.

207
00:18:01,400 --> 00:18:02,598
Rich people these days

208
00:18:02,599 --> 00:18:03,880
are always up to something.

209
00:18:04,079 --> 00:18:05,880
They keep mistresses on the side.

210
00:18:05,960 --> 00:18:07,720
Having a mistress is one thing.

211
00:18:07,839 --> 00:18:10,199
The funniest thing is when
they have illegitimate children.

212
00:18:10,440 --> 00:18:12,038
I heard that Zhou family.

213
00:18:12,039 --> 00:18:12,680
The Zhou family?

214
00:18:12,960 --> 00:18:13,880
Which Zhou family?

215
00:18:13,920 --> 00:18:15,240
You know, the famous one.

216
00:18:15,480 --> 00:18:16,720
Not anymore.

217
00:18:16,839 --> 00:18:17,839
Not long ago, they brought home

218
00:18:17,840 --> 00:18:19,159
an illegitimate son from out of town.

219
00:18:19,160 --> 00:18:20,358
He's already in his twenties.

220
00:18:20,359 --> 00:18:22,240
Now everyone calls him the second son.

221
00:18:22,799 --> 00:18:25,200
An illegitimate son that old?

222
00:18:25,920 --> 00:18:27,400
Could he be after the family fortune?

223
00:18:28,359 --> 00:18:29,599
It probably won't come to that.

224
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:32,039
If the Ji and Zhou families
form a marriage alliance,

225
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:33,439
then who knows?

226
00:18:33,440 --> 00:18:34,759
Zhou Yang has a younger brother.

227
00:18:43,039 --> 00:18:44,079
You're still awake.

228
00:18:44,200 --> 00:18:44,599
Yeah.

229
00:18:44,599 --> 00:18:45,599
Big Brother Shen.

230
00:18:47,160 --> 00:18:48,160
By the way,

231
00:18:49,319 --> 00:18:52,160
does Zhou Yang have a younger brother?

232
00:18:54,240 --> 00:18:56,880
It's true. He does.

233
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:58,758
And apparently,

234
00:18:58,759 --> 00:19:00,399
he's the son of Mr. Zhou's old flame

235
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:01,640
from when he was young.

236
00:19:02,160 --> 00:19:03,735
He's only two years younger than Zhou Yang.

237
00:19:03,759 --> 00:19:06,160
He was recently welcomed
back into the family.

238
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:09,480
I did see him at dinner yesterday.

239
00:19:09,640 --> 00:19:11,039
He's not bad-looking,

240
00:19:11,200 --> 00:19:12,358
but you can tell at a glance he's no good.

241
00:19:12,359 --> 00:19:13,880
He's the smooth-talking type.

242
00:19:14,160 --> 00:19:15,959
He certainly knows how to flatter Mr. Zhou.

243
00:19:15,960 --> 00:19:17,680
Mr. Zhou even got him a job at the company.

244
00:19:17,799 --> 00:19:19,439
That's why Mrs. Zhou

245
00:19:19,440 --> 00:19:20,359
called Zhou Yang

246
00:19:20,360 --> 00:19:22,039
back from overseas overnight.

247
00:19:22,519 --> 00:19:25,680
When Mr. and Mrs. Zhou were young,

248
00:19:25,839 --> 00:19:27,399
they treated each other with
respect their whole lives.

249
00:19:27,400 --> 00:19:28,519
So many people envied them.

250
00:19:30,440 --> 00:19:33,119
Who would've thought he'd do
something like that when he was young?

251
00:19:35,640 --> 00:19:38,279
But Zhou Yang and I
are definitely different.

252
00:19:38,519 --> 00:19:41,319
We grew up together, after all.

253
00:19:41,519 --> 00:19:43,839
We have the kind of bond
no one can compare to, right?

254
00:19:44,400 --> 00:19:45,200
Mm-hmm.

255
00:19:45,240 --> 00:19:45,960
Right.

256
00:19:45,960 --> 00:19:46,960
Of course.

257
00:19:47,519 --> 00:19:48,720
It's getting late.

258
00:19:49,039 --> 00:19:50,519
I'll get some rest.

259
00:19:50,759 --> 00:19:51,815
You should get some sleep, too.

260
00:19:51,839 --> 00:19:52,440
Good night.

261
00:19:52,440 --> 00:19:52,920
Mm.

262
00:19:52,920 --> 00:19:53,920
Good night.

263
00:20:00,480 --> 00:20:02,240
That's not fair to Miss Ji.

264
00:20:02,519 --> 00:20:03,519
What?

265
00:20:03,880 --> 00:20:06,039
She thinks she and Zhou
Yang are truly in love.

266
00:20:11,079 --> 00:20:12,559
If you can't get over Zhou Yang,

267
00:20:13,160 --> 00:20:14,960
don't use An'an as a cover.

268
00:20:15,920 --> 00:20:17,319
On the twelfth,

269
00:20:18,519 --> 00:20:20,519
he actually came to me first.

270
00:20:22,680 --> 00:20:23,680
Mm.

271
00:20:23,799 --> 00:20:26,000
So he knew all along.

272
00:20:26,839 --> 00:20:30,200
Were those two plane
tickets intentional, too?

273
00:20:31,039 --> 00:20:33,000
Even if he did ask to meet you, so what?

274
00:20:34,319 --> 00:20:36,119
He still chose An'an in the end.

275
00:20:36,559 --> 00:20:38,039
That's because of you, Mr. Ji.

276
00:20:38,079 --> 00:20:39,799
You think I threatened Zhou Yang.

277
00:20:39,920 --> 00:20:40,960
You're wrong.

278
00:20:42,759 --> 00:20:44,400
I don't have that kind of power.

279
00:20:45,920 --> 00:20:47,719
All I did was tell Zhou Yang in advance

280
00:20:47,720 --> 00:20:48,440
about something.

281
00:20:48,720 --> 00:20:49,999
I told him his father had

282
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:51,319
another illegitimate son.

283
00:20:51,759 --> 00:20:53,599
He wasn't the Zhou family's only heir.

284
00:20:54,440 --> 00:20:55,598
Everything he does

285
00:20:55,599 --> 00:20:56,599
could potentially affect

286
00:20:56,600 --> 00:20:58,440
his future standing in the Zhou family.

287
00:21:01,240 --> 00:21:03,719
I laid out all the pros and cons for him.

288
00:21:03,720 --> 00:21:05,799
Then he made his own decision.

289
00:21:07,640 --> 00:21:09,359
Just like he did three years ago.

290
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:11,440
Zhou Yang is a smart man.

291
00:21:11,880 --> 00:21:13,079
He always has been.

292
00:21:14,559 --> 00:21:15,640
What you get that way

293
00:21:16,799 --> 00:21:18,599
is nothing but fake love.

294
00:21:19,759 --> 00:21:21,960
These days, only middle
schoolers talk about love.

295
00:21:22,880 --> 00:21:24,640
Adults care about money and power.

296
00:21:25,519 --> 00:21:27,399
When you get down to
it, everything's business.

297
00:21:29,799 --> 00:21:31,358
Do you know how much
marrying into the Zhou family

298
00:21:31,359 --> 00:21:33,119
would benefit both
the Zhou and Ji families?

299
00:21:33,599 --> 00:21:34,759
As for love,

300
00:21:36,279 --> 00:21:37,679
whether you like each other or not,

301
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:41,120
you tie the knot first and
figure out the rest later.

302
00:21:41,240 --> 00:21:42,800
Once you've lived together long enough,

303
00:21:43,839 --> 00:21:45,279
feelings will develop eventually.

304
00:21:51,000 --> 00:21:53,200
Just like you and me, Mr. Ji?

305
00:21:57,473 --> 00:21:59,393
Tie me down first and
figure out the rest later.

306
00:22:03,759 --> 00:22:05,079
You can leave whenever you want.

307
00:22:05,249 --> 00:22:07,633
So you can be with that Zhao Yi
out in the open.

308
00:22:08,400 --> 00:22:10,119
You think Zhao Yi and I...

309
00:22:16,633 --> 00:22:18,240
Are you jealous?

310
00:22:25,799 --> 00:22:27,200
I know my place.

311
00:22:30,400 --> 00:22:32,519
I'll fulfill my responsibilities.

312
00:22:33,640 --> 00:22:34,960
As for anything else,

313
00:22:37,680 --> 00:22:39,039
do as you please, Mr. Ji.

314
00:22:41,279 --> 00:22:42,720
Just as you said, Mr. Ji,

315
00:22:44,759 --> 00:22:46,480
it's all business.

316
00:22:50,119 --> 00:22:52,240
What in this world isn't business?

317
00:22:53,599 --> 00:22:56,200
Is running away with Zhou
Yang what you call love?

318
00:23:19,599 --> 00:23:21,200
You're right, Mr. Ji.

319
00:23:21,880 --> 00:23:23,640
Isn't it all just a business deal?

320
00:23:24,359 --> 00:23:26,519
You and I are no different.

321
00:23:27,519 --> 00:23:28,880
We're just employer and employee.

322
00:23:32,519 --> 00:23:33,880
That Zhao Yi?

323
00:23:34,079 --> 00:23:35,518
The one who just became famous?

324
00:23:35,519 --> 00:23:37,199
Everyone says he has powerful connections.

325
00:23:37,559 --> 00:23:38,758
Anyone trying to make it in show business

326
00:23:38,759 --> 00:23:39,920
has someone backing them.

327
00:23:41,240 --> 00:23:42,240
But still,

328
00:23:42,319 --> 00:23:43,720
he's pretty handsome.

329
00:23:43,759 --> 00:23:44,799
And he's a nice guy.

330
00:23:45,119 --> 00:23:47,079
I hadn't really heard of him before.

331
00:23:47,319 --> 00:23:49,640
But lately, he's been everywhere.

332
00:23:49,759 --> 00:23:50,960
He's the lead in every show.

333
00:23:51,079 --> 00:23:52,199
He just has a good eye

334
00:23:52,200 --> 00:23:53,400
for choosing the right people.

335
00:23:55,000 --> 00:23:58,302
I heard Zhao Yi and our CEO Ji have a thing.

336
00:23:59,519 --> 00:24:02,318
Isn't CEO Ji with Shen Mo from our company?

337
00:24:02,319 --> 00:24:03,359
What do you know?

338
00:24:03,480 --> 00:24:05,359
Don't all rich men have several women?

339
00:24:05,680 --> 00:24:08,000
And can Shen Mo really
compare to a famous star?

340
00:24:08,440 --> 00:24:09,000
True.

341
00:24:09,000 --> 00:24:10,000
You're right.

342
00:24:30,319 --> 00:24:31,719
Don't wait for me after work today.

343
00:24:31,960 --> 00:24:32,960
Just go home.

344
00:24:33,359 --> 00:24:34,440
I won't be home for dinner.

345
00:24:36,160 --> 00:24:37,920
Do you have a business dinner tonight?

346
00:24:39,000 --> 00:24:40,000
No.

347
00:24:40,519 --> 00:24:42,079
Zhao Yi invited me out.

348
00:24:46,559 --> 00:24:48,160
Have fun, Mr. Ji.

349
00:25:02,480 --> 00:25:03,480
Shen, big brother.

350
00:25:05,839 --> 00:25:07,319
Why are you the only one home?

351
00:25:07,720 --> 00:25:08,720
Where's my brother?

352
00:25:09,240 --> 00:25:10,880
Mr. Ji has a business engagement tonight.

353
00:25:11,680 --> 00:25:12,680
Another one?

354
00:25:13,039 --> 00:25:15,119
He promised to have dinner with me tonight.

355
00:25:15,559 --> 00:25:16,640
Not this again.

356
00:25:16,720 --> 00:25:18,136
Something came up at the last minute.

357
00:25:18,160 --> 00:25:19,920
He's out entertaining
clients all year long.

358
00:25:20,079 --> 00:25:22,759
I wonder how many meals
we'll actually get to share.

359
00:25:23,079 --> 00:25:23,880
Shen, big brother.

360
00:25:23,881 --> 00:25:25,279
How do you put up with him?

361
00:25:25,799 --> 00:25:26,799
I'm used to it.

362
00:25:28,200 --> 00:25:28,880
Honestly.

363
00:25:29,200 --> 00:25:30,920
You really are patient, Shen.

364
00:25:32,359 --> 00:25:33,920
You could always go see Zhou Yang.

365
00:25:34,960 --> 00:25:37,279
Zhou Yang's been busy
dealing with family matters.

366
00:25:37,880 --> 00:25:40,000
But it shouldn't affect him too much.

367
00:25:40,160 --> 00:25:41,278
My brother said

368
00:25:41,279 --> 00:25:42,720
it'll be resolved soon.

369
00:25:43,559 --> 00:25:45,575
My brother's very reliable
when it comes to things like this.

370
00:25:45,599 --> 00:25:47,079
He always keeps his word.

371
00:25:48,039 --> 00:25:51,480
Why don't you give
my brother a call, Shen?

372
00:25:52,119 --> 00:25:53,720
Tell him to come home early.

373
00:25:53,960 --> 00:25:55,480
Mr. Ji is busy.

374
00:25:55,599 --> 00:25:56,599
It wouldn't be right.

375
00:25:56,720 --> 00:25:58,279
Please, I'm begging you.

376
00:25:58,559 --> 00:25:59,838
My brother listens to you more than anyone.

377
00:25:59,839 --> 00:26:01,000
He doesn't even listen to me.

378
00:26:01,480 --> 00:26:01,920
Fine, fine.

379
00:26:01,920 --> 00:26:02,920
All right.

380
00:26:03,240 --> 00:26:05,118
But don't get your hopes up.

381
00:26:05,119 --> 00:26:06,119
Okay.

382
00:26:10,279 --> 00:26:11,279
Hello?

383
00:26:11,839 --> 00:26:12,839
Mr. Ji.

384
00:26:13,359 --> 00:26:14,359
Mm?

385
00:26:14,480 --> 00:26:18,799
Miss Ji wants you to come home early
and have dinner with her.

386
00:26:19,519 --> 00:26:21,200
Tell her not to be so spoiled.

387
00:26:21,799 --> 00:26:23,119
I'm busy out here.

388
00:26:23,880 --> 00:26:24,880
Okay.

389
00:26:32,000 --> 00:26:33,000
What about you?

390
00:26:33,200 --> 00:26:34,440
Do you want me to come home?

391
00:26:36,119 --> 00:26:37,000
Mr. Ji,

392
00:26:37,079 --> 00:26:38,079
you're the boss.

393
00:26:38,119 --> 00:26:39,559
You can do whatever you want.

394
00:26:39,759 --> 00:26:41,519
This isn't about what I want.

395
00:26:42,079 --> 00:26:43,079
Okay.

396
00:26:43,960 --> 00:26:45,559
You see me as your boss, then?

397
00:26:46,279 --> 00:26:48,039
Would you do what I say?

398
00:26:48,200 --> 00:26:49,200
Mm-hmm.

399
00:26:49,960 --> 00:26:51,599
Since that's how you see it,

400
00:26:51,960 --> 00:26:53,559
come here now.

401
00:26:55,359 --> 00:26:56,359
All right.

402
00:26:58,478 --> 00:27:00,551
[An address for a "International
Entertainment Center"]

403
00:27:24,880 --> 00:27:26,119
Why aren't you drinking?

404
00:27:35,160 --> 00:27:36,400
I'll sing.

405
00:27:59,400 --> 00:28:00,439
He's here.

406
00:28:00,440 --> 00:28:01,440
Have a seat.

407
00:28:08,799 --> 00:28:09,799
Come on, come on.

408
00:28:10,400 --> 00:28:12,320
Now that Mr. Ji has
graced us with his presence,

409
00:28:13,000 --> 00:28:14,519
shouldn't you raise a glass?

410
00:28:14,960 --> 00:28:16,000
What are you doing?

411
00:28:16,799 --> 00:28:18,160
I'll drink one with him myself.

412
00:28:26,680 --> 00:28:28,119
Why don't we wait and drink later?

413
00:28:31,759 --> 00:28:33,079
What's the fun in making a toast?

414
00:28:34,880 --> 00:28:35,880
Feed me.

415
00:29:03,319 --> 00:29:04,319
Shen Mo.

416
00:29:04,519 --> 00:29:05,319
Don't forget,

417
00:29:05,320 --> 00:29:06,839
you're nothing but a hired lover.

418
00:29:13,680 --> 00:29:14,680
Mr. Ji.

419
00:29:15,160 --> 00:29:16,160
I'm leaving.

420
00:29:17,480 --> 00:29:18,480
Hey.

421
00:29:18,839 --> 00:29:19,839
Since you're already here,

422
00:29:19,840 --> 00:29:21,159
can't you have a drink before you go?

423
00:29:21,160 --> 00:29:21,920
Exactly.

424
00:29:21,960 --> 00:29:23,599
Who leaves right after arriving?

425
00:29:23,880 --> 00:29:24,920
You can leave if you want,

426
00:29:25,279 --> 00:29:26,519
but finish this drink first.

427
00:29:26,799 --> 00:29:28,039
Bottoms up.

428
00:29:32,480 --> 00:29:33,079
Why aren't you drinking?

429
00:29:33,080 --> 00:29:34,400
Why are you still standing there?

430
00:29:35,400 --> 00:29:36,240
Are you refusing to show
your big brother some respect?

431
00:29:36,241 --> 00:29:37,480
I can't drink.

432
00:29:37,799 --> 00:29:40,078
What kind of man can't
even hold his liquor?

433
00:29:40,079 --> 00:29:41,240
Have a drink, handsome.

434
00:29:41,480 --> 00:29:42,559
If you won't drink this,

435
00:29:43,000 --> 00:29:44,599
you're disrespecting Mr. Ji.

436
00:29:44,640 --> 00:29:45,640
How about this?

437
00:29:45,720 --> 00:29:46,799
Don't drink it.

438
00:29:46,880 --> 00:29:48,440
Sing a song for everyone.

439
00:29:48,519 --> 00:29:49,160
Everyone,

440
00:29:49,161 --> 00:29:50,960
do you want to hear this handsome guy sing?

441
00:29:51,240 --> 00:29:52,240
What do you want to sing?

442
00:29:52,400 --> 00:29:53,135
Sing something.

443
00:29:53,160 --> 00:29:53,920
Come on.

444
00:29:53,921 --> 00:29:55,720
Everyone's waiting for you.

445
00:29:57,880 --> 00:29:59,000
I can't sing.

446
00:30:03,039 --> 00:30:04,240
Look at you.

447
00:30:04,559 --> 00:30:06,920
You won't sing or drink.

448
00:30:07,319 --> 00:30:09,119
Then why did you come?

449
00:30:09,359 --> 00:30:10,880
What a buzzkill.

450
00:30:13,079 --> 00:30:14,079
Hey.

451
00:30:14,559 --> 00:30:15,680
Some people

452
00:30:16,079 --> 00:30:18,200
will entertain you, but
they won't sleep with you.

453
00:30:18,519 --> 00:30:19,400
But then again,

454
00:30:19,401 --> 00:30:22,852
some people... tee-hee tee-hee tee-hee

455
00:30:23,880 --> 00:30:25,720
He can't sing, so stop forcing him.

456
00:30:26,105 --> 00:30:27,146
Seriously.

457
00:30:27,240 --> 00:30:28,799
Then don't leave, handsome.

458
00:30:28,960 --> 00:30:30,359
Stay and keep us company.

459
00:30:31,880 --> 00:30:33,440
If I drink, you'll let me leave?

460
00:30:34,400 --> 00:30:35,160
Of course.

461
00:30:35,161 --> 00:30:36,200
Drink up, and you can go.

462
00:30:38,119 --> 00:30:39,119
No.

463
00:30:42,839 --> 00:30:44,000
He's with me.

464
00:30:45,000 --> 00:30:47,160
He can leave or stay whenever he wants.

465
00:30:48,759 --> 00:30:50,239
Does anyone have a problem with that?

466
00:30:52,279 --> 00:30:53,559
They were only joking.

467
00:30:53,680 --> 00:30:54,920
Don't be angry, Mr. Ji.

468
00:31:01,400 --> 00:31:02,400
It's fine.

469
00:31:04,119 --> 00:31:05,119
I'll drink.

470
00:31:26,279 --> 00:31:27,279
Your turn.

471
00:31:58,640 --> 00:32:00,559
You never listen.

472
00:32:40,400 --> 00:32:41,400
Mr. Ji.

473
00:32:42,440 --> 00:32:43,440
You're awake.

474
00:32:48,680 --> 00:32:50,839
Why did you sleep here last night, Mr. Ji?

475
00:32:53,440 --> 00:32:55,200
Because you had to
prove yourself last night

476
00:32:58,240 --> 00:32:59,640
and downed a whole glass of liquor.

477
00:33:04,680 --> 00:33:07,279
And if An'an found out we
were sleeping in separate beds,

478
00:33:08,079 --> 00:33:09,519
wouldn't she think that was strange?

479
00:33:11,119 --> 00:33:12,920
I'll stay here for the next couple of days.

480
00:33:17,000 --> 00:33:18,319
An'an is getting engaged.

481
00:33:19,440 --> 00:33:21,480
You'll come with me to
the engagement party.

482
00:33:22,920 --> 00:33:23,920
Mr. Ji.

483
00:33:25,279 --> 00:33:26,759
Our contract

484
00:33:27,617 --> 00:33:29,955
ends when An'an gets married, right?

485
00:33:29,980 --> 00:33:30,980
Yes.

486
00:33:33,119 --> 00:33:34,799
Do you want to terminate the contract?

487
00:33:36,279 --> 00:33:37,440
We can do it now.
